    "Raw summed kernel duration grows under contention and double-counts overlap; it must not be interpreted as measured energy regression.",
    "The production optimization is limited to exact aligned C32 NVFP4 MLP gate/up projections. Decode and every other prefill route remain serial.",
    "The change is layer-local branch overlap, not Prefill/Decode overlap, double/triple buffering, continuous batching, or concurrent request scheduling.",
